Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a winter fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.\NShine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong, just that\Nyou can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a revolutionary? Army buddy? Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to wake him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came to see him before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.48,0:03:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So soon? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some trouble heading\Ntowards Dressrosa as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's CP0.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the Doflamingo mix-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They played a key role in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be real cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are gonna get a bit crazy\Naround here in a day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be in your best interest to hit the\Nroad as soon as possible. We appreciate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it thank you I'm still kind of shocked\Nthat Luffy has another brother right it's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the first I heard of it that figures I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,think it surprised Luffy most of all you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,want to follow up on that one many years
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,ago I was presumed to\Nbe dead Luffy Ace and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,were inseparable, running amok\Nand raising all sorts of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In the city, in the forest, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ol' Garp would try his\Nbest to keep us in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but we wanted to grow up and be pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We made a vow and became brothers\Nby sharing some sake together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But one day, I was\Ninvolved in a bad accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, a bad incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:04:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with this town!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong with these people!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They know people are gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're happy people are going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They're sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole place is sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stay here any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to tell them right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.54,0:05:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Ace! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.28,0:05:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hightown wreaks worse than\NGrey Terminal ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The people act civilized, but on\Nthe inside, they're all rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.54,0:05:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They only care about making themselves\Nlook good no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do, then I'll never be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish I could see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.10,0:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks nice from the outside,\Nbut this house is a birdcage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna lose my mind if I have to\Nstay in this stuffy, stuck-up place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I found freedom, but\Nit seems to keep slipping away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, we'll be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody, please, help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly kept me waiting. What\Ncould be more important than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, oh goodness, is that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,that boy's in rough shape?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurt boy, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the medic, prepare treatment! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't startle the poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.13,0:07:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rude, you big ol' meaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You were on board our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It says Sabo on all your belongings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:08:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that's your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then what is your name, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Think he lost his memory? Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me the kid\Ndoesn't remember a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.78,0:08:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not even his own name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I found the boy washed up ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Over in the highland of the Goa kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that means he's\Ngot some noble blood in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you his parents are worried sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We should take him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.56,0:08:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have a feeling\Ntelling me not to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me you didn't get\Nyour memories back until two years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised they came\Nback to you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda weird, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually have Ace to\Nthink for that. Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Or that's what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened in the worst\Npossible way, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That tragedy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,is what awakened my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the second in command—perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow us to the situation room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The war in marine four just ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way to a\Nbriefing about it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,think one of the four emperors is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Eva? They okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't say—not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,not here The only reported\Ndeaths are the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard, and Firefist Ace, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dragon, read this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It says here that you're\NStraw Hat Luffy's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.00,0:10:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,be so
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,tough that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.23,0:10:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,all the other pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and all the marines will bow at my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:11:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gonna be the legacy\NI leave behind when I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you're acting bizarre
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,let
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,me tell
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,a secret it says Aka Inu punched a hole
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,right through Ace's chest
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,all
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it takes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,to become brothers is to share some Sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll always be brothers, and\Nnobody can take that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, we're\Nhonest-to-goodness brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's come over you, Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who died wasn't\Njust any old pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't some dangerous\Nmenace of the great pirate era.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that needed to be stumped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace is my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't catch me running\Naway, and I'll never lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The chief's awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We all thought you were gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You big jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a really high fever, Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been out for three days straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.26,0:13:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You got your memory back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who I am, where I'm from, even the\Nwhole reason I left home and set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.78,0:14:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.36,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't leave, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know if Dragon's still around? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,At that moment, it felt like\NAce took me aside and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're Sabo, and you're\Na brother of mine and Luffy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am. Sorry it took\Nso long, Ace. Take a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,look at this you'll be\Nhappy to hear luffy's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,well on his way to\Nbecoming the king of the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,pirates that's our badass\Nlittle brother for you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask of\Nthe Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a Devil Fruit that\NI need to get my hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, what about the\Nflame flame fruit, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one guy I hope\Ndoesn't win, but it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The lives of my friends matter way more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go and save the day and let old\NBato take care of the tournament for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awesome, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you're getting the\NFlame Flame Fruit, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Luffy. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who the hell you\Nthink you are, but that's Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy to you, you damn punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flame Flame Fruit belonged\Nto his brother, Firefist Ace,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so nobody deserves to\Nhave it more than him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, he's gonna be King of the\NPirates one day, you jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've known that for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You show up out of nowhere and\Ntell me I can't have the fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, don't know ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, that flame flame fruit\Nbelonged to my brother Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.64,0:17:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you're calling Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real, buddy. My name is Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I would recognize my own brother anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, pal—only two people\Ncan call me their brother:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.98,0:17:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,ace, and my other brother who died!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,died
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How else would I know we stole booze\Nfrom Dadan and shared it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you been all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come see me sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.24,0:18:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally thought you were dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.98,0:19:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That means a lot, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're alive too, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sambo, but I saw Ace die and\NI couldn't do anything to help save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Ace may not be with\Nus, but at least you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know how grateful I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I nearly lost two brothers without\Nbeing able to do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If something awful happened to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,then I wouldn't have anyone\Nelse left now, would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for staying alive this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:19:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you let me eat the\Nflame flame fruit then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I really think it should be yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.78,0:20:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.34,0:20:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what he's dreaming about right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,See you around. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to see his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is a fever card of Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I had one made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking a piece as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm sure that Luffy can be a\Nhandful, but keep an eye on it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bet, you pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.98,0:21:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny, I remember Ace\Nsaying the same exact thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo, this is Hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just left the house. Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.59,0:21:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And how was Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He seemed like he was quite a...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.66,0:21:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Galick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he hang up, the papa's ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I'm not Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are we pretty much good to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.32,0:21:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, anytime. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get back to Baratie, there's so\Nmuch I want to tell Dragon about Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.50,0:22:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Till next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.88,0:22:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.08,0:22:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Be my eyes, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What did it come up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,One, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.80,0:22:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So be it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the odds are in Straw Hat's favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.06,0:22:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what we agreed on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd say he won this\Nround fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be no arrests tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.56,0:22:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.47,0:22:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Isho, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We worked hard to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And you let them go over a dice roll?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And after lashing out at\Nthe Fleet Admiral, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be our best chance\Nto bring in Law and the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.46,0:22:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Maynard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know better\Nthan to take a gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.76,0:23:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,than complain about the outcome of a role.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.24,0:23:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite unbecoming of a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.98,0:23:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen Lucy after the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.40,0:23:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to at least thank him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably just laying low.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether they're pirates or criminals,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't change the fact\Nthat they're our saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.12,0:23:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and we owe them everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.56,0:23:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandfather!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.72,0:23:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been able to find\NFather Lucy or the others yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.76,0:23:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros has already contacted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They are all safe together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.70,0:23:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That aside, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.78,0:23:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I agree to return to the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:24:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You do understand that\Nwe'll make you a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.30,0:24:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To think after all the effort it\Ntook to escape Big Mom's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.68,0:24:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to\Nmake any more trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.08,0:24:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think you get a vote?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.54,0:24:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit whining!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.52,0:24:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying this is a\Nwarning to your crew—you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.34,0:24:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,shouldn't stick your\Nnose into their affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.28,0:24:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to wait for the ship quietly,\Nbut no, you just had to go rushing ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and do what I tell you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.94,0:24:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you handle that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.36,0:24:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I can crush your heart\Nand not lose any sleep over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.02,0:24:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.28,0:25:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't like it coming\Nto shore—was the best idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.98,0:25:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a chance we can save them,\Nbut we need you to cooperate with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.80,0:25:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm so important,\Nperhaps you should be nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.34,0:25:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.76,0:25:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you taunted me enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.88,0:25:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.68,0:25:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take as much time as I see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.96,0:25:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Noisy raccoon—I'm a reindeer pal,\Nas if there's any difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.36,0:25:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course there is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.50,0:25:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.18,0:25:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen—if they die, I'm gonna\Nmake sure you pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your help, so move your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.36,0:25:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so move your butt
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.50,0:25:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's really hard\Nto run on this ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.22,0:25:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish we hadn't been separated\Nfrom Sanji and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.30,0:25:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.60,0:26:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We were too focused on\Nthat mysterious girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.88,0:26:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.66,0:26:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help myself, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.24,0:26:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.30,0:26:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tim will be as bad as I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.58,0:26:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.49,0:26:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.96,0:26:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.38,0:26:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.16,0:26:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We caught ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.06,0:26:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, tell us where you\Nhid the young lady. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.08,0:26:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And how'd you invaders\Nget onto this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.76,0:26:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just anyone could... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.22,0:26:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.52,0:27:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, what is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.98,0:27:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes a rain rupture!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.28,0:27:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.98,0:27:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.56,0:27:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.54,0:27:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it raining?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.38,0:27:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's more like a geyser!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.96,0:27:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you,\Nwhatever may happen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.60,0:27:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.44,0:27:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama Nozki!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.72,0:27:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.70,0:27:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm drowning!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.54,0:27:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.45,0:27:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You Devil Fruit guys are so delicate!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.06,0:27:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going on my!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.48,0:27:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm useless to you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.30,0:27:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.00,0:28:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn invaders!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.62,0:28:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't just lay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.88,0:28:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.12,0:28:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You get it too, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.82,0:28:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.94,0:28:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.44,0:28:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.20,0:28:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.24,0:28:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.18,0:28:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.92,0:28:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.02,0:28:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.93,0:28:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.92,0:28:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Slousy corn, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with his arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.78,0:28:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How far, full?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.70,0:29:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.02,0:29:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.93,0:29:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul parade!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.12,0:29:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bokiji's so brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.38,0:29:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of a birdie is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.02,0:29:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.42,0:29:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep him occupied!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.60,0:29:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.74,0:29:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablo!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.65,0:29:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mutom! Mallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.90,0:29:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sheep's Head, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.30,0:29:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.16,0:29:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Nami, my sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.38,0:29:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.64,0:29:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Took the words right out of my...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.14,0:29:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.28,0:30:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Jinrami!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.60,0:30:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, retreat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.92,0:30:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sheep's Head has been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.86,0:30:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But we haven't found the samurai yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.18,0:30:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't shown himself even\Nafter we pushed them this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.92,0:30:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go report that there's\Nno samurai here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.86,0:30:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The water's draining.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.58,0:30:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what that was all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.26,0:30:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is rather odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.82,0:30:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that girl's okay too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.82,0:30:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She moves faster than we\Ndo, so I'm sure she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.56,0:30:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.78,0:30:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Chopper. I'm on it. Let\Nus make haste. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.70,0:30:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got no time to lose
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.74,0:31:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.62,0:31:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're out cold. Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.00,0:31:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a giant hole! A hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.36,0:31:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Something fell here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.90,0:31:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Arm yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.12,0:31:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That crater, it's massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.38,0:31:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have made this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.14,0:32:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and who the heck's responsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.58,0:32:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's kinda shaped like a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.86,0:32:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A person that's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.48,0:32:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I did hear a legend once about a sky\Nisland where a great monster lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.40,0:32:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's somewhere around here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.96,0:32:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight: that\Nthing fell from a sky island.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.88,0:32:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The impact was so bad it just
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.86,0:32:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,capsized one of our ships—capsized it,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.30,0:32:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,who's behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.66,0:32:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,this I'll set them straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.04,0:32:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The strong survive and the weak perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.20,0:32:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the way our world has always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.24,0:32:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A few minutes prior.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.48,0:33:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do we have\Nhere? I don't know, but we
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.74,0:33:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,should leave him alone he\Nmust be crazy we're 30 000
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.96,0:33:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,feet high that's not exactly\Na short drop this was
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.94,0:33:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,a man who was desperately\Nin search of a place to die
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.02,0:33:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I to stop him?\NHe'd had an eventful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.18,0:33:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,as a pirate he had tasted\Ndefeat seven times and
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.98,0:33:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,on 18 separate occasions he'd been\Ncaptured by the Navy or enemy ships he'd
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.72,0:33:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,spent quite some time as a prisoner and\Nsuffer through torture again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.56,0:33:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,His objective was to take his\Nown life by the unusual means of
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.18,0:33:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,plummeting off the edge of a sky
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.34,0:34:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,island and now we
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.18,0:34:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,return to the present
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.78,0:34:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to reiterate this is a man who\Nrepeatedly challenged the navy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.96,0:34:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and the four emperors was captured\N18 times and was sentenced to
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.54,0:34:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,death 40 times when he was hanged\Nthe chain crumbled into pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.92,0:34:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When he was sent to be beheaded,\Nthe guillotine blade shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.22,0:34:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,when he was to be impaled\Nthe spear broke additionally
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.18,0:34:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,he sank a total of nine\Nprison vessels in other
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.70,0:34:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,words no one was capable\Nof killing him in fact he
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.72,0:34:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,was incapable of killing
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.06,0:34:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,himself
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.06,0:34:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,now
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.44,0:34:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.96,0:35:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, it really is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.08,0:35:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.78,0:35:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.28,0:35:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So I survived again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.22,0:35:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so hard to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.84,0:35:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That daughter in the old\NWhitebeard, he pulled it off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.76,0:35:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who longed for a place to\Ndie, King of the Beasts, Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.86,0:35:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who know of him\Nhave a certain saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.58,0:36:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's one-on-one, always bet on Kylo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.66,0:36:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether on land, at sea, or in the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.56,0:36:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a widely held belief\Nthat this terrifying pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.64,0:36:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,is more powerful than any\Nother living creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.28,0:36:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.28,0:36:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.58,0:36:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Joker!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.72,0:36:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for the final battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.42,0:36:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.36,0:36:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If this dreary world\Nis destroyed, so be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.36,0:36:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start history's greatest war!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.26,0:36:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you with me?
